#N canvas 10 40 1490 840 12;
#X text 20 10 mpc-iml-toolkit front end for every preset (ADR 0006 \, group 2 Kit from ADR 0007 \, clock from ADR 0008 \, group 8 Ensemble from ADR 0009). Start it with uv run mpc-iml \, or start the engine first (python -m mpc_iml.engine <folder>). It connects on open. Click connect after starting the engine. Pd vanilla 0.54 or later \, no externals., f 120;
