#X text 20 10 All control messages go out through one [netsend] (UDP 6450). Replies (6451) and model outputs (12000) are fanned out with [s mpciml-<reply>]. Unknown replies are ignored. /mpciml/preset has 2 elements \; longer messages under preset are preset replies \, of which only ensemble's are used (ADR 0009)., f 110;
